                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontsize="9" fontcolor="#52514e">Money is in units and rests on assumptions (src/config/retention_assumptions.yaml), not bank figures. Drift scenarios are SIMULATED: the dataset has no time column, so only the train-vs-test column is a real comparison.</run>
